            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Dictate Anywhere 2.12.14

- Show the automatically selected microphone by name in the menu bar and settings when it can be identified.
- Remove the unavailable-microphone warning when automatic fallback is in use. Your preferred microphone is still remembered for when it becomes available again.
]]></description>
